# Cursor OpenSpec & Multi-IDE Rules

## 1. Core Workflow (OpenSpec)
- This project follows **Spec-Driven Development (OpenSpec)**.
- Active changes reside in `openspec/changes/YYYY-MM-DD-描述/`.
- All requirements, architectural designs, and implementation checklists must be drafted in `proposal.md`, `design.md`, and `tasks.md`.

## 2. Multi-IDE Collaboration Protocol (`review-log.md`)
- Use `review-log.md` to coordinate between Antigravity, Windsurf, Claude Code, and Cursor.
- Status tags: `[待讨论]`, `[需修正]`, `[已达成共识]`, `[通过]`.
